#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:5
#: fc9a72810d33485d90508a6b28d70622
msgid "Building for NAVIO2 on RPi3"
msgstr "在 RPi3 上为 NAVIO2 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:8
#: aa5fe08726784e6a81530b5e651e2452
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:10
#: faee5d9d05f048719a7079dcaed1e379
msgid ""
"These instructions clarify how to build ArduPilot for the Navio2 board on "
"the Navio2's RPi3 board itself using Waf build system. These instructions "
"assume the RPi3 has already been setup according to the manufacturer's (i.e."
" Emlid's) instructions `here <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-"
"APM/configuring-raspberry-pi/>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些说明阐述了如何使用 Waf 构建系统，在 Navio2 的 RPi3 板上为 Navio2 飞控板构建 ArduPilot。这些说明假设 RPi3 "
"已按照制造商（即 Emlid）的说明完成配置，详见 `此处 <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-"
"APM/configuring-raspberry-pi/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:16
#: fc37048dde7b4bc098aa7507fbe4ed4f
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can follow Emlid's instructions on how to build from "
"source found `here <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-APM/building-from-"
"sources/>`__."
msgstr ""
"你也可以参考 Emlid 的从源码构建说明，详见 `此处 <http://docs.emlid.com/navio2/Navio-"
"APM/building-from-sources/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:21
#: 23d4a3f6a01f4da4b1374de083902c50
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "环境配置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:23
#: 524331feb3754f1287de859e133d16af
msgid ""
"Use an ssh terminal program such as `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__ to log"
" into the Navio2 board's RPI3."
msgstr "使用 SSH 终端程序（例如 `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__）登录 Navio2 板的 RPI3。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio2-on-rpi3.rst:28
#: 6d9a9638d8544b209135bae99306fec6
msgid ""
